Spawn a boneyard of radius 5 around you that lasts for 8 turns.

Any foes inside gain the brittle bones effect, reducing their physical resistance by [5%, 8%, 10%, 13%, 15% (TL1-5)] and making all cooldowns [10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)] longer.

When one of your minions stands in the boneyard they gain [10, 25, 36, 46, 55 (TL1-5)] more physical and spell power.

At level 5 when a minion dies inside the boneyard it has a [1%, 3%, 5%, 7%, 9% (TL1-5)] chance to resurrect instantly. This effect may only happen once per minion.
